          "innerHTML": "<div style='font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#111; line-height:2.0;'><p>To Whom It May Concern,</p><p style='margin-top:20px;'>Enclosed you will find the press materials and lookbook for the upcoming Spring/Summer 2027 collection. This season focuses on structural minimalism, utilizing innovative recycled fabrics developed exclusively in our Italian mills.</p><p style='margin-top:20px;'>Please note that all imagery is under strict embargo until Monday, the 14th of September at 9:00 AM CET.</p><p style='margin-top:20px;'>For any press inquiries or sample requests, please contact our PR department directly.</p><p style='margin-top:60px;'>Sincerely,</p><p style='font-weight:700; margin-top:20px;'>The PR Team<br>MAISON V</p></div>",
